OL,3,GNEWSANew report sparks fresh calls to
OL,4,Asave water tower
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners fighting to save a Grade II
OL,7,Flisted water tower say a report
OL,8,Fhighlighting its deterioration has
OL,9,Fstrengthened calls for urgent action
OL,10,Fover its future.
OL,12,FA structural survey of Gawthorpe's
OL,13,Fwater tower, commissioned by owner
OL,14,FYorkshire Water, warns refurbishment
OL,15,Fwork is needed to prevent the 55m
OL,16,F(180ft) landmark falling further into
OL,17,Fdisrepair.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
