OL,3,GNEWSANew report sparks fresh calls to
OL,4,Asave water tower
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Burley, who is leading the
OL,7,Fcampaign to save the tower, said the
OL,8,Ffindings meant a decision on its future
OL,9,Fcould no longer be delayed and renewed
OL,10,Fhis offer for campaigners to take on
OL,11,Fthe restoration.
OL,13,FYorkshire Water said it was reviewing
OL,14,Fthe implications of the report but
OL,15,Fstressed the tower was subject to
OL,16,Fhealth and safety and access
OL,17,Fprocedures.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
